  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen &#xe4;r en systemrevision av organsationen RCN Jusntice &amp; D&#xe9;mocratie genomf&#xf6;rd av Professional Management under juli - augusti 2012. Revisionen &#xe4;r ett led i beredningsprocessen av projektf&#xf6;rslaget &quot;Improving the Management of Land by Strenthening the Prevention and Resulution of Land Conflicts&quot; i Rwanda.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution is a review of the internal control systems of the organisation RCN Justice &amp; D&#xe9;mocratie performed by Professional Management during July - August 2012. The review is part of the appraisal of the project proposal &quot;Improving the Management of Land by Strenthening the Prevention and Resulution of Land Conflicts&quot; in Rwanda.</narrative>
  </description>
